    "text": "Dow Update\nSalesforce, Microsoft share losses contribute to Dow's 312-point drop\nShares of Salesforce and Microsoft are trading lower Wednesday afternoon, sending the Dow Jones Industrial Average into negative territory.\nShares of Salesforce Salesforce Inc. and Microsoft Microsoft Corp. have contributed to the index's intraday decline, as the Dow Dow Jones Industrial Average was most recently trading 312 points (0.6%) lower.\nAbout the Author",
